  "title": "Malignant melanoma",
  "body_system": "cancer",
  "version": 1,
  "summary": "Malignant melanoma (skin, ocular, or mucosal) meeting one of: A) recurrent after wide excision (skin) or enucleation (ocular); B) metastases to clinically apparent nodes, 4+ non-apparent nodes, or distant/satellite sites; OR C) mucosal melanoma (any).",
